id #uuid "5f2c79f3-97e6-548b-8685-36366eddad46" :question/math-academy-id "q-23641" :question/problem "Simplify $4{csc}^{2}⁡(2x)+4{csc}^{2}⁡(2x)\\cdot {cot}^{2}⁡(2x).$" :question/worked-solution "First, we factor the $4{csc}^{2}⁡(2x)$ from the first two terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{csc}^{2}⁡(2x)+4{csc}^{2}⁡(2x)\\cdot {cot}^{2}⁡(2x) & =4{csc}^{2}⁡(2x)\\cdot (1+{cot}^{2}⁡(2x))\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, using the identity $1+{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta ={csc}^{2}⁡\\theta ,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{csc}^{2}⁡(2x)\\cdot (1+{cot}^{2}⁡(2x)) & =4{csc}^{2}⁡(2x)\\cdot {csc}^{2}⁡(2x) \\\\  & =4{csc}^{4}⁡(2x).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-23641/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d012a04e-f802-5a26-b900-0801427073d8"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-23641"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-23642/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "cab01cb8-13a9-5fe7-9d50-dad9bf518fd1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-23642/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" :answer/id #uuid "bfe9b67d-2ac2-58c3-bd0b-a2ed74166a6a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-23642/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "70dd332f-6682-5af3-af9a-a99cfbe7d788" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-23642/selection/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" :answer/id #uuid "b88b3400-a144-5321-a313-6afddfae4281" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-23642/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "51d4f4a9-93ed-5058-a49c-a779152f8904" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-23642/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "a53bf309-e383-56f4-ada2-2b2bc1a527a2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-23642/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer-field/choices ["q-23642/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" "q-23642/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5e490" "q-23642/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" "q-23642/selection/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" "q-23642/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-23642" :question/id #uuid "3347dbbd-2b9c-577c-823e-1e0af531c1e6" :question/math-academy-id "q-23642" :question/problem "Simplify ${csc}^{4}⁡\\theta -{cot}^{4}⁡\\theta -2{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta .$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the following identity:\n\n$$\n{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta ={csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above identity into the given expression, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{csc}^{4}⁡\\theta -{cot}^{4}⁡\\theta -2{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta  & ={csc}^{4}⁡\\theta -{({cot}^{2}⁡\\theta )}^{2}-2{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & ={csc}^{4}⁡\\theta -({csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1)^{2}-2({csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1) \\\\  & ={csc}^{4}⁡\\theta -({csc}^{4}⁡\\theta -2{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta +1)-2{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta +2 \\\\  & ={csc}^{4}⁡\\theta -{csc}^{4}⁡\\theta +2{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1-2{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta +2 \\\\  & =\\cancel{{csc}^{4}⁡\\theta }-\\cancel{{csc}^{4}⁡\\theta }+\\cancel{2{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta }-1-\\cancel{2{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta }+2 \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-23642/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "240a0a0b-fb86-5760-bb2b-74275708ff77"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-23642"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-23896/selection/edb0ac007884289ce23f3fae57ec27526ff98fc4ec3e93d8e6a90df2f1357269" :answer/id #uuid "a81c7e11-82d5-5dfa-b339-86619e18c957" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{cot}^{2}⁡x-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-23896/selection/9ab48649008bac28ee0df62c64cc3060c4fde298bac9feaef461ab0fe2acf074" :answer/id #uuid "aa53ac72-23b0-5c92-a5ff-e75d89d0aac7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{cot}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-23896/selection/65155ed23bf7a682aaeaf75d6c377dc91771579080a86fd383e90ddd6118c1ec" :answer/id #uuid "10b69990-e6f1-5ae0-844e-7dc1eaa11331" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{cot}^{2}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-23896/selection/db9261ba32573026e20e956859fd3fd30df5c6128b4cec01786d82be9470be4a" :answer/id #uuid "745b2c9b-b74d-5fcc-b04c-eed2929f6ceb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cot}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-23896/selection/439742957327c43749f38ba28939be8c8bc9af228dd643ceb2b5e0ed7bb2539c" :answer/id #uuid "60ee82ec-35af-5669-96d3-0fdc66c45968" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{cot}^{3}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-23896/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "9d8b12bb-1772-5aca-a84b-116ee29b1720" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-23896/selection/65155ed23bf7a682aaeaf75d6c377dc91771579080a86fd383e90ddd6118c1ec" :answer-field/choices ["q-23896/selection/edb0ac007884289ce23f3fae57ec27526ff98fc4ec3e93d8e6a90df2f1357269" "q-23896/selection/9ab48649008bac28ee0df62c64cc3060c4fde298bac9feaef461ab0fe2acf074" "q-23896/selection/65155ed23bf7a682aaeaf75d6c377dc91771579080a86fd383e90ddd6118c1ec" "q-23896/selection/db9261ba32573026e20e956859fd3fd30df5c6128b4cec01786d82be9470be4a" "q-23896/selection/439742957327c43749f38ba28939be8c8bc9af228dd643ceb2b5e0ed7bb2539c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-23896" :question/id #uuid "7c085e7d-0f68-5a2c-8e0d-44c214128ae8" :question/math-academy-id "q-23896" :question/problem "Simplify ${sec}^{2}⁡x({cot}^{2}⁡x-{cos}^{2}⁡x).$" :question/worked-solution "First, we expand the parentheses using the distributive property. This gives \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{sec}^{2}⁡x({cot}^{2}⁡x-{cos}^{2}⁡x) & ={sec}^{2}⁡x\\cdot {cot}^{2}⁡x-{sec}^{2}⁡x\\cdot {cos}^{2}⁡x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\cdot \\frac{{cos}^{2}⁡x}{{sin}^{2}⁡x}-\\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡x}\\cdot {cos}^{2}⁡x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{{sin}^{2}⁡x}-1 \\\\  & ={csc}^{2}⁡x-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nNow, using the identity ${csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1={cot}^{2}⁡\\theta $, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{sec}^{2}⁡x({cot}^{2}⁡x-{cos}^{2}⁡x) & ={cot}^{2}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-23896/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "240a0a0b-fb86-5760-bb2b-74275708ff77"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-23896"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-74574/selection/619d89e96a97634085e0708b9c9fb875b0dce8a4185996ff1679e8689ab5b971" :answer/id #uuid "44c79046-ca07-53c5-90ab-3e14704e8ec0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74574/selection/f7ab346981c65944d81d32a3ad298b4ed2bcfb33b169396a567b1a3ea51e6590" :answer/id #uuid "22e60410-6bde-5320-aed2-947f66970f80" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta -1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74574/selection/53c9cc53c9151a84ee0fa4eb42f3c6e72ec949096bdc0a8e9511a23936508243" :answer/id #uuid "76801278-231d-5c53-8bb9-0f171ad67744" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74574/selection/dcac5de6c4ad6d9d47530db01072299672d5d2a27115900895a15d2add385105" :answer/id #uuid "45ef3959-b562-5978-a65f-18c6e3e8d936" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74574/selection/45ba5db4c4017ee3a1bce229a169f875d8313fcbc76b4d72f60083f66b0ba711" :answer/id #uuid "46ad00c6-cf0b-5e9f-a4a2-a4d68188191b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1-\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74574/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "6af0b178-0edc-555c-b1a9-86618f9f696e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-74574/selection/619d89e96a97634085e0708b9c9fb875b0dce8a4185996ff1679e8689ab5b971" :answer-field/choices ["q-74574/selection/619d89e96a97634085e0708b9c9fb875b0dce8a4185996ff1679e8689ab5b971" "q-74574/selection/f7ab346981c65944d81d32a3ad298b4ed2bcfb33b169396a567b1a3ea51e6590" "q-74574/selection/53c9cc53c9151a84ee0fa4eb42f3c6e72ec949096bdc0a8e9511a23936508243" "q-74574/selection/dcac5de6c4ad6d9d47530db01072299672d5d2a27115900895a15d2add385105" "q-74574/selection/45ba5db4c4017ee3a1bce229a169f875d8313fcbc76b4d72f60083f66b0ba711"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-74574" :question/id #uuid "b657ea15-f662-5aac-b5df-ef7c4e3fa824" :question/math-academy-id "q-74574" :question/problem "Simplify $\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta {cot}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1}-\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta .$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the following identity: \n\n$$\n{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta ={csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above identity into the given expression, and then factoring it as a difference of squares, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta {cot}^{2}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1}-\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta ({csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -1)}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1}-\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta (\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1)(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1)}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1}-\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta (\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1)\\cancel{(\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1)}}{\\cancel{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta -1}}-\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta (\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +1)-\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta +\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta +\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-74574/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "85555bce-debf-5165-ba6a-3c232deeeb0a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-74574"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-120321/selection/0ecd8130b3138cc0d0b6f7dcff937e8b23344457055155bb5dd25cda061cdc23" :answer/id #uuid "69c62fcb-eb94-55c5-8bb9-c82b3fc85eef" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120321/selection/a24f96f0ea2f9896e68b078d7205cc9f34ac80b4ed9c403eaa0714db3d124d8c" :answer/id #uuid "f88f28d3-9d77-5402-bbf5-118c1ef09a01" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1-\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120321/selection/c51d6bca88f98479112b0f808b9d3ac75b69035fbf6da11b1a8a5fde3b6741b6" :answer/id #uuid "2542d822-da3b-593d-b74c-db161ad2faad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta -1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120321/selection/82c45f4df2439620e53b221a8cd624df48d9a9a6f528bc089ec82dd3f3a9dba5" :answer/id #uuid "8a47a6ba-9928-58fc-b846-0a16ef4f92f1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta +1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120321/selection/a796d9c5991eedc0c0038d430bce3b9f068fbd29e0532cf1c80f916e01bb5117" :answer/id #uuid "cf7e66e2-b1b1-589f-868b-d2bb405efd18" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120321/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "715a0180-bb8f-5e5e-9bb8-dd58bcdc984c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-120321/selection/0ecd8130b3138cc0d0b6f7dcff937e8b23344457055155bb5dd25cda061cdc23" :answer-field/choices ["q-120321/selection/0ecd8130b3138cc0d0b6f7dcff937e8b23344457055155bb5dd25cda061cdc23" "q-120321/selection/a24f96f0ea2f9896e68b078d7205cc9f34ac80b4ed9c403eaa0714db3d124d8c" "q-120321/selection/c51d6bca88f98479112b0f808b9d3ac75b69035fbf6da11b1a8a5fde3b6741b6" "q-120321/selection/82c45f4df2439620e53b221a8cd624df48d9a9a6f528bc089ec82dd3f3a9dba5" "q-120321/selection/a796d9c5991eedc0c0038d430bce3b9f068fbd29e0532cf1c80f916e01bb5117"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-120321" :question/id #uuid "655ed1ae-c368-568f-96ff-f056393d3a86" :question/math-academy-id "q-120321" :question/problem "Simplify $\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta \\,{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -\\frac{1}{{tan}^{3}⁡\\theta }.$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the identity\n\n$$\n{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta =1.\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above identity into the given expression and using the fact that $\\frac{1}{{tan}^{3}⁡\\theta }={cot}^{3}⁡\\theta ,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta \\,{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -\\frac{1}{{tan}^{3}⁡\\theta } & =\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta \\,{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -{cot}^{3}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta \\,({csc}^{2}⁡\\theta -{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta ) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta \\cdot 1 \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-120321/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "85555bce-debf-5165-ba6a-3c232